== Sales ==
Since its debut in November 2004, the Swift has been sold in 170 countries. As of July 2025, sales of the Swift had reached cumulative worldwide sales of 10 million units (includes the [[Suzuki Dzire|Swift sedan]]). Of the 10 million units sold worldwide, 60% were in India, 14% in Europe, 8% in Japan, and 18% in other countries.<ref>{{cite press release |title=SUZUKI INTRODUCES THE ALL-NEW SWIFT|url=https://www.globalsuzuki.com/globalnews/2025/0904.html |publisher=Suzuki|date=4 September 2025}}</ref>

